uestions?</h2><p itemProp="description" class="text-caption-l text-font-secondary whitespace-pre-wrap">We’ve answered the most frequently asked questions</p></header><details class="landing-faq-item group border-b border-divider-primary pt-2"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-5 py-4 text-lg font-semibold transition hover:text-font-secondary active:text-font-disabled [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden list-none"><span class="text-left">What is Seedance 2.5?</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M3.81344 7.97848C4.0087 7.78322 4.32528 7.78322 4.52055 7.97848L10.0003 13.4583L15.4801 7.97848C15.6754 7.78322 15.9919 7.78322 16.1872 7.97848C16.3825 8.17374 16.3825 8.49032 16.1872 8.68558L10.3539 14.5189L10.0003 14.8725L9.64677 14.5189L3.81344 8.68558C3.61818 8.49032 3.61818 8.17374 3.81344 7.97848Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4 text-sm text-font-secondary whitespace-pre-line">ByteDance’s flagship AI video model. It generates cinematic clips up to 30 second, with synchronized sound, up to 50 references, and region-level editing — all in a single pass.</div></details><details class="landing-faq-item group border-b border-divider-primary pt-2"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-5 py-4 text-lg font-semibold transition hover:text-font-secondary active:text-font-disabled [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden list-none"><span class="text-left">What’s new compared to Seedance 2.0?</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M3.81344 7.97848C4.0087 7.78322 4.32528 7.78322 4.52055 7.97848L10.0003 13.4583L15.4801 7.97848C15.6754 7.78322 15.9919 7.78322 16.1872 7.97848C16.3825 8.17374 16.3825 8.49032 16.1872 8.68558L10.3539 14.5189L10.0003 14.8725L9.64677 14.5189L3.81344 8.68558C3.61818 8.49032 3.61818 8.17374 3.81344 7.97848Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4 text-sm text-font-secondary whitespace-pre-line">About 20% better prompt adherence, region-level editing instead of full regeneration, tighter character and lighting consistency, and audio born in the same pass as the picture.</div></details><details class="landing-faq-item group border-b border-divider-primary pt-2"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-5 py-4 text-lg font-semibold transition hover:text-font-secondary active:text-font-disabled [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden list-none"><span class="text-left">How long and what resolution can videos be?</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M3.81344 7.97848C4.0087 7.78322 4.32528 7.78322 4.52055 7.97848L10.0003 13.4583L15.4801 7.97848C15.6754 7.78322 15.9919 7.78322 16.1872 7.97848C16.3825 8.17374 16.3825 8.49032 16.1872 8.68558L10.3539 14.5189L10.0003 14.8725L9.64677 14.5189L3.81344 8.68558C3.61818 8.49032 3.61818 8.17374 3.81344 7.97848Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4 text-sm text-font-secondary whitespace-pre-line">Up to 30 seconds per generation — in any aspect ratio from vertical 9:16 to widescreen 21:9.</div></details><details class="landing-faq-item group border-b border-divider-primary pt-2"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-5 py-4 text-lg font-semibold transition hover:text-font-secondary active:text-font-disabled [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden list-none"><span class="text-left">Does it generate sound?</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M3.81344 7.97848C4.0087 7.78322 4.32528 7.78322 4.52055 7.97848L10.0003 13.4583L15.4801 7.97848C15.6754 7.78322 15.9919 7.78322 16.1872 7.97848C16.3825 8.17374 16.3825 8.49032 16.1872 8.68558L10.3539 14.5189L10.0003 14.8725L9.64677 14.5189L3.81344 8.68558C3.61818 8.49032 3.61818 8.17374 3.81344 7.97848Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4 text-sm text-font-secondary whitespace-pre-line">Yes. Ambience, foley, and score are produced together with the visuals and matched to on-screen action. No separate audio step, no syncing by hand.</div></details><details class="landing-faq-item group border-b border-divider-primary pt-2"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-5 py-4 text-lg font-semibold transition hover:text-font-secondary active:text-font-disabled [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden list-none"><span class="text-left">How many references can I use?</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M3.81344 7.97848C4.0087 7.78322 4.32528 7.78322 4.52055 7.97848L10.0003 13.4583L15.4801 7.97848C15.6754 7.78322 15.9919 7.78322 16.1872 7.97848C16.3825 8.17374 16.3825 8.49032 16.1872 8.68558L10.3539 14.5189L10.0003 14.8725L9.64677 14.5189L3.81344 8.68558C3.61818 8.49032 3.61818 8.17374 3.81344 7.97848Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4 text-sm text-font-secondary whitespace-pre-line">Up to 50 multimodal inputs — images and clips — to lock characters, products, locations, and style across the whole video.</div></details><details class="landing-faq-item group border-b border-divider-primary pt-2"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-5 py-4 text-lg font-semibold transition hover:text-font-secondary active:text-font-disabled [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden list-none"><span class="text-left">Can it keep the same character across scenes?</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M3.81344 7.97848C4.0087 7.78322 4.32528 7.78322 4.52055 7.97848L10.0003 13.4583L15.4801 7.97848C15.6754 7.78322 15.9919 7.78322 16.1872 7.97848C16.3825 8.17374 16.3825 8.49032 16.1872 8.68558L10.3539 14.5189L10.0003 14.8725L9.64677 14.5189L3.81344 8.68558C3.61818 8.49032 3.61818 8.17374 3.81344 7.97848Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4 text-sm text-font-secondary whitespace-pre-line">Yes. Reference a face once and it holds identity, wardrobe, and lighting through every shot. Pair it with Higgsfield Soul for even tighter identity control.</div></details><details class="landing-faq-item group border-b border-divider-primary pt-2"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-5 py-4 text-lg font-semibold transition hover:text-font-secondary active:text-font-disabled [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden list-none"><span class="text-left">How do I get the best results?</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M3.81344 7.97848C4.0087 7.78322 4.32528 7.78322 4.52055 7.97848L10.0003 13.4583L15.4801 7.97848C15.6754 7.78322 15.9919 7.78322 16.1872 7.97848C16.3825 8.17374 16.3825 8.49032 16.1872 8.68558L10.3539 14.5189L10.0003 14.8725L9.64677 14.5189L3.81344 8.68558C3.61818 8.49032 3.61818 8.17374 3.81344 7.97848Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4 text-sm text-font-secondary whitespace-pre-line">Write the prompt like a shot list: subject, camera, lighting, mood, sound. Add references for anything that must stay consistent, and fix mistakes with region edits instead of re-rolling.</div></details></section>